{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21928","headline":"羸骏 · 白居易","name":"羸骏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骅骝失其主，羸饿无人牧。\n向风嘶一声，莽苍黄河曲。\n蹋冰水畔立，卧雪冢间宿。\n岁暮田野空，寒草不满腹。\n岂无市骏者，尽是凡人目。\n相马失於瘦，遂遗千里足。\n村中何扰扰，有吏徵刍粟。\n输彼军廐中，化作驽骀肉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}